The worktree already contains unrelated modifications and deletions in .spec/decisions.md, .spec/platform-distribution.md, task-board.config.json, many historical .task-board paths, and other generated/research files. Treat them as foreign user work. Do not restore, rewrite, stage, commit, or otherwise modify them. Scope file changes to the new focused specification plus directly necessary README.md and docs/current-state.md edits, and board updates through task-board only.




