+This is the source of truth for extending the current macOS menu-bar SOCKS app
+from one tunnel to independently controlled, concurrent tunnels. The current
+release remains a one-tunnel application; this document is not a claim that
+multi-tunnel support has shipped. The future VPN remains governed by the other
+documents in this directory.
